"]},"A ready-made phrase for seniors to deflect unwanted offers"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Avoid any “investment-based senior care” schemes that require upfront payments: card enrollment, prepaid care fees, buying senior housing units, travel-based care programs, and sales of senior products all fall under the same category of illegal fundraising"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Apart from the housing reverse mortgage insurance offered by insurers, you should avoid all other “housing-for-pension” schemes — never mortgage your home to buy financial products"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/17-07","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"For elderly individuals at home who are bedridden or severely disabled, apply to the local yibao (basic medical insurance) office for long-term care insurance; it is not limited to seniors only"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"For families with someone bedridden at home, pressure ulcers are a top concern: use an electric alternating-pressure air mattress, turn the patient regularly, and check bony areas daily"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"If an older person’s cataracts already affect walking safely, have an eye doctor assess surgery; when both eyes are affected, do not delay the second eye too long"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/17-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"When an older person walks a dog, hold the leash in the palm and never wrap it around the hand, keep the leash short, and train the dog first not to lunge forward on the leash"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/17"},"children":["Chapter 17"," ·"," ","Having elderly family members at home"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"17-07"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["07"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["For elderly individuals at home who are bedridden or severely disabled, apply to the local yibao (basic medical insurance) office for long-term care insurance; it is not limited to seniors only"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Long-term care insurance helps cover the cost of hiring caregivers. Those who are severely disabled and have remained in that condition for at least six months may apply to their local yibao office. Eligible care expenses do not need to be paid upfront; roughly 70% is reimbursed for employees covered under the worker policy, while about 50% is reimbursed for residents enrolled in the urban/rural resident policy. However, costs such as room charges and meals are not covered. Though often mistaken for a senior-specific program, official documents refer to “insured persons” without any age restriction — even younger individuals with severe disabilities may apply."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["You only need to visit the local yibao office once to subm…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no deductible threshold for approved long-term care services;"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: For elderly individuals at home who are bedridden or severely disabled, apply to the local yibao (basic medical insurance) office for long-term care insurance; it is not limited to seniors only"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["You only need to visit the local yibao office once to submit an application and undergo a disability assessment. If you pass the assessment on the first try, the evaluation fee is covered by the insurance fund — no out-of-pocket expense is required."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no deductible threshold for approved long-term care services; you do not need to pay a set amount out-of-pocket before reimbursement begins. Approximately 70% of eligible costs are reimbursed for workers, and about 50% for urban/rural residents. The maximum annual payout cannot exceed 50% of the local average per-capita disposable income for residents in that region."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国家医保局等八部门 (2026). 关于印发《加快建立长期护理保险制度实施方案》的通知. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202603/content_7063915.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202603/content_7063915.htm"]},"：保障对象为「按规定参保缴费且失能状态长期持续（一般为6个月以上），经申请通过评估认定的失能人员」，「制度起步阶段保障重度失能人员」；「待遇享受不设起付标准。符合规定的长期护理服务费用，按未就业城乡居民参保政策参保的，基金支付比例为50%左右；按单位职工参保政策参保的，基金支付比例为70%左右，退休人员享受单位职工参保待遇」；「参保人员基金年度最高支付限额不超过统筹地区上年度城乡居民人均可支配收入的50%」；「待遇享受固定等待期原则上按照6个月设置」；另见中共中央办公厅、国务院办公厅《关于加快建立长期护理保险制度的意见》. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12666/202604/content_7065119.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2026/issue_12666/202604/content_7065119.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202603/content_7063915.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Disability must be “long-term and continuous” — generally lasting six months or more; a few weeks of hospitalization does not qualify. A six-month waiting period applies before benefits can be claimed. Expenses unrelated to care, such as room fees or meals, are not covered by this insurance. Medical costs normally paid by yibao are also excluded. Individuals already receiving work-related injury care benefits cannot claim both simultaneously. This insurance is separate from disability-related subsidies; they follow different application procedures and provide distinct financial aid, as detailed in Section 7, Article 8. Care received at home or in community settings receives preferential reimbursement rates; institutionalization is not mandatory. Implementation varies by region, and assessment criteria differ locally. Contact 12393 or your local yibao office to confirm whether the program is active in your area and how to schedule an evaluation. Even if an initial assessment fails, reapplication is possible once disability worsens."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]}